Einhell's belt sanders are compact, powerful tools with a variety of different applications. These include sanding planks, boards and wooden profiles as well as sanding pallets, joists, beams, veneers and other wooden materials.
Dec 21, 2014.– The Bosch ROS20VSC random orbital sander is a professional device designed to deliver high sanding speed, versatility and ease of use for wood, plastic and metal surfaces. Bosch’s hook and loop attachments let you customize the shape of the sanding pad to your needs for more precise results. The rotary pad is designed to have maximum grip at all times, ensuring that it doesn’t slip during use. It’s equipped with a strong electronic speed control that lets you choose a sanding speed between 7500 and 12,000 OPM.The tool’s powerful 1.0 Ah motor has a torque of 2.28 Nm, which lets you sand in all kinds of shapes and contours. It’s suitable for all surfaces and is easy to handle thanks to the ergonomic, rubberized handle and the comfort grip feature The microcellular backing pad is pliable to ensure a long-lasting, ultra-smooth finish on both Flat and contoured surfaces alike.The TE-RS 40 E comes equipped with an onboard air filter that ensures low dust output and helps guarantee you a clean finish.
